SEE ALSO
     calendar(1), cron(8)

DIAGNOSTICS
     Complains about various syntax errors and times out of
     range.
     If the process dies during execution look in
     /_u_s_r/_s_p_o_o_l/_a_t/_p_a_s_t for the executing file.  The mail file is
     the same name as the executing file except the first number
     has been changed to 'M'.

BUGS
     Scripts beginning with a '#' are assumed to be csh scripts;
     this may be inappropriate for scripts that start with
     "#!/bin/sh".

